    "body": "Bringing in my comment from the MSEdgeExplainer repo:\r\n\r\nFrom the beginning I've been in favor of having new elements for the new controls as it also allows us to keep some native ones and specific needs for certain capabilities (window escape, etc). As we discussed in our explainer I'm also a fan of the built-in parts, while maybe leveraging WC parts under the hood being elements themselves as well so it is 100% apparent what is standard/ships with the UA and what is user land code.",
