    "body": "A new element makes a lot more sense to me.\r\n\r\nIf you go that route, I would suggest trying to unify `<select>` with the current `<input type=\"text\">` + `<datalist>` combination. E.g. work on a `<combobox>` element. Developers are consistently tripped up by the fact that these similar controls have very different interfaces.",
